{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415482","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415482","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041548201:1":{"text":"이봐, 젊은이!","source_cn":"嘿，小伙子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D606C63EF9195E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548202:1":{"text":"낯선 신호, 경계 태세.","source_cn":"陌生信号，警戒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6049C652944DE810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548203:1":{"text":"젊은이, 그렇게 긴장하지 말라고. 난 그냥 자네를 연구해 보고 싶은 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"小伙子，别那么紧张。我只是想好好研究研究你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DC0F1179F9C2D8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548204:1":{"text":"자네의 기계 장치는 매우 정교해! 이것 좀 봐, 기어, 체인... 호호, 눈의 설상봉합까지 아주 완벽하다고!","source_cn":"你身上的机巧十分精致！瞧瞧，齿轮、锁链……嚯嚯，就连你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4138BE43FDFF878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548205:1":{"text":"자네를 만든 사람은 분명 내 동족일 거야. 틀림없어. 자네를 만든 사람의 이름이 뭔지 아직 기억하고 있나?","source_cn":"制作你的人肯定是我的同胞，这准没错，你还记得制作你的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ACB38AB441CCCD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548206:1":{"text":"...본 기계, 카렌.","source_cn":"……本机体，铐兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5495E698D7E2C7FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548207:1":{"text":"오, 자네의 이름은 당연히 알고 있지, 젊은이. 그것만 반복하는 건 의미가 없어.","source_cn":"噢，我当然知道你的名字，小伙子。光重复这些没意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F9A83495EF3C0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548208:1":{"text":"정말 자네를 다시 뜯어 연구해 보고 싶군. 내부 구조를 한 번만 자세히 살펴보기만 해도 비슷한 기계인형을 만들어낼 자신이 있는데 말이야!","source_cn":"真想再把你拆开研究研究，只要再仔细观察一次你的内部构造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DF21EECBA537B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548209:1":{"text":"재조, 금지. 고통... 계속되면 안 됨.","source_cn":"再造，禁止。痛苦……不能延续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C67FDA601EEFA67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548210:1":{"text":"저지!","source_cn":"——阻止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30267C133593F359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548211:1":{"text":"워후, 화내지 말라고! 내 자네를 다시 하나 더 만든 다는 것도 아니고...","source_cn":"嚯，嚯，别生气！我不是说要再造一个你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x723172936A6A8013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548212:1":{"text":"기계 소리가 심상치 않아졌군. 좋아, 뜯어내진 않을게. 포기한다고! 이제 그만 침착해!","source_cn":"机器的声音更不妙了——好吧，我放弃逆向计划，我放弃！平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0400FF90235A0498","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铐兰":{"text":"카렌","source":"铐兰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}